This file is a placeholder. Until the DuelSight release exists, builds are tested against the
cardvision toolkit's 20-card toy release. A package built against it is a development build, not a
DuelSight release: replace this file, LICENSE and PROVENANCE.md with the DuelSight models' own
(first line: "... (id <the release id>)") before any store or release upload. The build refuses a
release whose id this first line does not name.

The files in the release folder (release.json, detector.onnx, recognizer.onnx, bank.json,
bank.identity-groups.json, catalog.json) are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The full text is in the file LICENSE beside this one.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
What the models are
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The toy release is built by the open-source cardvision toolkit from synthetic shapes
(https://github.com/ryangswe/riftsight-vision). It contains no card art, video frame or label of
any card game.

